<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Hospital Login</title>
</head>

<body>

```
<h1>Hospital Login</h1>

<p>Login using your registered hospital credentials.</p>

<% if (error) { %>
    <p><%= error %></p>
<% } %>

<form action="/hospital/login" method="POST">

    <label for="hospital_id">
        Hospital ID:
    </label>

    <br>

    <input
        type="text"
        id="hospital_id"
        name="hospital_id"
        required
    >

    <br><br>

    <label for="password">
        Password:
    </label>

    <br>

    <input
        type="password"
        id="password"
        name="password"
        required
    >

    <br><br>

    <button type="submit">
        Login
    </button>

</form>

<br>

<a href="/">
    Back to User Login
</a>
```

</body>

</html>
